     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par3/separator_copy_copy__6753605"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Lunchtime!</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Every day at 12 noon (except Sundays), a cannon fires from Signal Hill. Today, it reminds people in Cape Town that it’s time for lunch. But the Noon Gun originally had a different purpose: sailors used the signal to set their ships' clocks.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par5/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town/lh_app_capetown_illustration2_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Illustration on the left: a cannon from which a cuckoo shoots out as if from a cuckoo clock. Illustration on the right: a person playing on a golf course. "
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>On the Green</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Golf fans, take note: there are around 20 golf courses in the greater Cape Town area alone. No wonder South Africa is one of the world’s most popular destinations for golfers.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Who Could Say No?</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Cape Town is one of the most popular places in the world for marriage proposals. The famous question is asked particularly often on Table Mountain. Those looking to make it truly unforgettable can even hire an agency to organize the perfect proposal.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/africa/essentials-cape-town-facts/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par9/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/africa/essentials-cape-town/lh_app_capetown_illustration3_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Illustration of Table Mountain surrounded by the houses of Cape Town. Above the mountain, there is a speech bubble containing the word 'yes.'"
     },
     {
